Z||000003||jake1852||07-23-2001||08:36 PM||||hey adrift- there is a guy on ebay who sells those cross drilled chrome pedals with fiero engraved on them. sells them in standard and automatic. i just bought some off of him, they are pretty nice. his e-mail is russellwh@carolina.rr.com <P>------------------<BR>- Unfinished ferrari kit, custom made myself<BR>-87 duke (just got it, its fast, and i dont know why yet!)<BR>- 87 GT<BR>- Tc Maserati (daily drive)||||reg||1
Z||000004||Adrift||07-23-2001||09:58 PM||||How much did they cost? Was it an automatic or manual set?<BR>Thanks<BR>Adrift<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||jake1852||07-24-2001||02:51 PM||||the guy has both. price was 63.50 including shipping, you can get them with fiero or ferrari on it||||reg||1
Z||000006||XDrewX||07-24-2001||03:33 PM||||I bought a pair off of this guy, i had him engrave mine to FIERO GT.  They look great, and even come with hardware and inst. for mounting.  The allen head bolts are very small and a wierd size.not metric.  <P>The only comment i have is from every one who saw the pedals before i put them on.....everyone said they looked cheap, because the aluminum they are made from is very thin.  but you cant really tell when they are mounted in the car.<P>they are way better than the plastic ones with the color in-fill that every honda civic has installed||||reg||1
Z||000007||Ditz88GT||07-24-2001||04:37 PM||||Hey, I have the ones with the color plastic in-fills...But I do agree, they do look a little cheap.  I saw nice aluminum ones on ebay last month or so, sounds like the ones you got.  They were much nicer than the ones I have, how hard were they to install?<P><P>------------------<BR>~Ditz88GT<P>E-mail: cditzler@hotmail.com<BR>AIM: Ditz88GT<BR>http://go.to/fiero||||reg||1
Z||000008||artherd||07-24-2001||07:55 PM||||I have the same pedals (the ones from Russ) I think they look pretty nice, and as you actually pull off the rubber and bolt them directly on, they're almost "functional" heh.<P>I tossed them on the night before a show, took me 15minuites tops.   Quality is very good, and I think he can engrave just about anything you want.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
